OL,3,AUS airman dies as daredevil descent
OL,4,Agoes wrong before Texas college
OL,5,Afootball game
OL,6,
OL,7,FA member of the US Air Force died after
OL,8,Fhe fell while abseiling from the
OL,9,Fceiling of a Texas stadium ahead of a
OL,10,Fcollege football game.
OL,12,FFootage shows the serviceman plummet
OL,13,Ffeet first to the turf midfield at San
OL,14,FAntonio's 170ft (52 metre) high
OL,15,FAlamodome on Saturday during a ceremony
OL,16,Fahead of the game between the
OL,17,FUniversity of Texas at San Antonio and
OL,18,Fthe Naval Academy.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
