OL,3,AUS airman dies as daredevil descent
OL,4,Agoes wrong before Texas college
OL,5,Afootball game
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe airman, identified by the military
OL,8,Fas Sgt Ian Patterson, a Tactical Air
OL,9,FControl Party instructor at Joint Base
OL,10,FSan Antonio, died in hospital.
OL,12,FThe incident is being investigated. The
OL,13,Fgame between the UTSA Roadrunners and
OL,14,Fthe Navy Midshipmen continued as
OL,15,Fplanned following the tragic incident.
